  "scope": "Native C++/Python calibrated scalar numerical kernels and original reference observations. Not completed measurement/profile/histogram/threshold UI, read-only target admission/publication, recorder integration or full ImageJ/Fiji certification.",
  "implementation": [
    "Add independent calibrated_analysis.hpp API, ImageJScalarStatistics and imagej_calibrated_statistics/imagej_calibrated_line_profile. Existing raw statistics/line_profile APIs and record formats unchanged. No expanded public command variant or existing public type layout/signature change.",
    "UInt8/UInt16/finite canonical Float32 statistics: raw processor histograms, ImageJ sample standard deviation, dtype-specific median/mode/NaN/infinity/empty behavior, area and integrated density. UInt16 raw_mean deliberately follows original umean/calibrated-mean behavior. Compact small-image histogram results do not retain65536 bins; both installed SDKs check this.",
    "Known version1 function provenance shares the existing native double function evaluator for median, including16-bit zero-clip differences. Mean still uses Float32 table. Custom/future table provenance remains opaque. Malformed recognized function provenance gives a validation error without normalizing its record.",
    "Scalar thin straight-line values use round(pixel length)+1 samples, repeated-addition coordinates, nearest or linear sampling, and density-before-interpolation. Endpoints restricted to inside-image; zero length allowed. No wide/polyline/bicubic/outside-domain/physical-axis/custom-count or non-finite Float32-source qualification.",
    "Working cap bounds histogram/table/median/profile scratch and returned vectors, not caller-owned pixels/masks, Python conversions, allocator overhead or RSS. Python freezes mutable spatial input before GIL release. Outputs are detached; kernels do not query an Application or validate context/publication.",
    "Original observers use the existing reviewed ImageJ1.54r/JDK cache. Pin complete original Java-source/class-tree identities plus JDK java/javac/modules/release before/after.77 independent rows:59 base,12 edge,6 function precision; deterministic gzip fixtures. No native-generated oracle or upstream Java/classes installed in products."
  ],
